= Introduction <introduction>

This book demonstrates how a single Typst project can produce
both a complete PDF book and a multi-page HTML website.

== Why use Typst?

Typst allows us to keep the actual content separate from the
way that content is exported.

For example, we can write:

- Chapter 1 in one file
- Chapter 2 in another file
- Chapter 3 in another file

and combine all of them into one PDF.

The same files can also be exported as separate HTML pages.

== A small example

Suppose we have the following equation:

$ revenue = price times quantity $

This equation will appear in both the PDF and HTML versions.

